@startuml C4_L4_WebGUI
title Пользовательский Web GUI — MVC/MV* структура (C4 L4)

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
left to right direction

package "cmd/api" {
    class APIMain as "main" {
        +main(): void
    }
}

package "web" {
    class WebRouter as "NewWebRouter" {
        +NewWebRouter(wh): http.Handler
    }

    class WebHandler {
        -productService: ProductService
        -categoryService: CategoryService
        -authService: AuthService
        -userService: UserService
        -orderService: OrderService
        -addressService: AddressService
        -sellerService: SellerService
        -reviewService: ReviewService
        -backofficeService: BackofficeService
        -templates: map[string]*template.Template
        +Catalog(w, r): void
        +ProductDetail(w, r): void
        +Profile(w, r): void
        +Orders(w, r): void
        +Cart(w, r): void
        +SellerDashboard(w, r): void
        +AdminUsers(w, r): void
        +AdminOrders(w, r): void
        +AnalystDashboard(w, r): void
    }

    class TemplateSet as "templates/*.html" {
        +layout.html
        +catalog.html
        +product.html
        +profile.html
        +orders.html
        +cart.html
        +seller.html
        +admin-users.html
        +admin-orders.html
        +analyst.html
    }

    class StaticFiles as "static/" {
        +css/style.css
    }

    class UserInfo {
        +UserID: int64
        +Role: string
        +FullName: string
        +actor(): service.Actor
    }
}

package "service" {
    class AuthService
    class UserService
    class ProductService
    class CategoryService
    class AddressService
    class OrderService
    class SellerService
    class ReviewService
    class BackofficeService
}

package "model" {
    class User
    class Product
    class Category
    class Address
    class Order
    class Seller
    class Review
    class PlatformStats
    class AdminOrderListOptions
}

package "repository" {
    interface UserRepo
    interface ProductRepo
    interface CategoryRepo
    interface AddressRepo
    interface OrderRepo
    interface SellerRepo
    interface ReviewRepo
    interface BackofficeRepo
}

class "PostgreSQL" as postgres <<database>>

APIMain ..> WebHandler : создаёт
APIMain ..> WebRouter : монтирует в mux
WebRouter *-- WebHandler : route -> handler method
WebRouter ..> StaticFiles : отдаёт /static/*

WebHandler *-- TemplateSet : parseFS + ExecuteTemplate
WebHandler ..> UserInfo : JWT cookie -> actor

WebHandler o--> AuthService
WebHandler o--> UserService
WebHandler o--> ProductService
WebHandler o--> CategoryService
WebHandler o--> AddressService
WebHandler o--> OrderService
WebHandler o--> SellerService
WebHandler o--> ReviewService
WebHandler o--> BackofficeService

WebHandler ..> User : template data
WebHandler ..> Product : template data
WebHandler ..> Category : template data
WebHandler ..> Address : template data
WebHandler ..> Order : template data
WebHandler ..> Seller : template data
WebHandler ..> Review : template data
WebHandler ..> PlatformStats : template data
WebHandler ..> AdminOrderListOptions : query -> options

UserService o--> UserRepo
ProductService o--> ProductRepo
CategoryService o--> CategoryRepo
AddressService o--> AddressRepo
OrderService o--> OrderRepo
SellerService o--> SellerRepo
ReviewService o--> ReviewRepo
BackofficeService o--> BackofficeRepo

UserRepo --> postgres : SQL
ProductRepo --> postgres : SQL
CategoryRepo --> postgres : SQL
AddressRepo --> postgres : SQL
OrderRepo --> postgres : SQL
SellerRepo --> postgres : SQL
ReviewRepo --> postgres : SQL
BackofficeRepo --> postgres : SQL для admin/analytics read models

note right of WebHandler
  В терминах MVC это Controller:
  принимает HTTP request, читает form/query,
  проверяет роль через cookie/JWT,
  вызывает service layer и передаёт data во View.
  SQL здесь не выполняется.
end note

note bottom of TemplateSet
  Это View слой серверного MPA:
  html/template получает готовые model/view data
  и формирует HTML-страницу.
end note

note bottom of service
  Model в Go-проекте разделён:
  model содержит структуры данных,
  service содержит use cases и RBAC,
  repository реализует доступ к PostgreSQL.
end note

@enduml
